\title{Independent evaluation and post-training potential}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{evaluation}
\tag{optimization}

\p{A training score cannot by itself answer how much reliable capability was
obtained. This section fixes an evaluation law, an inference procedure, and a
resource account before comparing post-training protocols.}

